  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.88,
      "e": 3.67,
      "text": "- [Reporter] A CH-53E Super Stallion helicopter"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.67,
      "e": 6.11,
      "text": "belonging to the 1st Marine Aircraft Wing"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.11,
      "e": 8.46,
      "text": "was conducting regularly scheduled training,"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.46,
      "e": 10.73,
      "text": "when it was forced to make an emergency landing"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.73,
      "e": 13.94,
      "text": "in a field outside Okinawa's northern training area"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.94,
      "e": 15.47,
      "text": "after an in-flight fire"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.47,
      "e": 18.89,
      "text": "at approximately 5:20 p.m., October 11th."
    },
    {
      "s": 19.07,
      "e": 20.73,
      "text": "1st Lieutenant Joseph Butterfield,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.73,
      "e": 23.05,
      "text": "III Marine Expeditionary Force Communications,"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.05,
      "e": 25.31,
      "text": "Strategy, and Operations Officer,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.31,
      "e": 27.94,
      "text": "says the safety of the community and Marines"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.94,
      "e": 30.55,
      "text": "is a priority in any training conducted."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.55,
      "e": 31.83,
      "text": "- [Joesph] We're thankful that there were no injuries"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.83,
      "e": 33.22,
      "text": "to the crew or civilians,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.22,
      "e": 35.7,
      "text": "and are also very grateful to the local first responders"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.7,
      "e": 37.31,
      "text": "who quickly put out the fire."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.31,
      "e": 39.8,
      "text": "We're currently working with the local and military police"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.8,
      "e": 41.22,
      "text": "to secure the site and determine"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.22,
      "e": 43.55,
      "text": "the most effective way to remove the aircraft."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.55,
      "e": 44.47,
      "text": "- [Reporter] The cause of the incident"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.47,
      "e": 46.36,
      "text": "is under investigation."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.36,
      "e": 48.29,
      "text": "Reporting from Okinawa, Japan,"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.29,
      "e": 50.27,
      "text": "I'm Lance Corporal Jonathan Pearson."
    }
  ],
